1
00:00:00,745 --> 00:00:03,785
(Raj:)It was gonna be like the old days.
The four of us hanging out...

2
00:00:03,956 --> 00:00:07,046
(Howard:)...playing video games,
before you guys all got girIfriends.

3
00:00:07,877 --> 00:00:11,757
(Raj:)Do you have any idea what it's like
to be the only one without a girIfriend?

4
00:00:11,923 --> 00:00:13,253
(Raj:)Even if I get one someday...

5
00:00:13,424 --> 00:00:17,554
(Raj:)...I'll still be the guy who got a girl
after Sheldon Cooper!

6
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,770
(Penny:)And that's how a girl makes a scene.

7
00:00:30,274 --> 00:00:32,654
I'm sorry. You're right.
You deserve your weekend.

8
00:00:32,819 --> 00:00:35,489
(Penny:)- Come on, Amy, let's go.
- What about the Science Center?

9
00:00:35,696 --> 00:00:38,616
Oh, I'll let you hold my hair
while I throw up.

10
00:00:40,118 --> 00:00:41,448
(Amy:)Rain check.

11
00:00:42,912 --> 00:00:45,292
- I'm gonna go too.
- I'll miss you.

12
00:00:45,456 --> 00:00:47,586
- I'll miss you.
- But I'll miss you more.

13
00:00:47,750 --> 00:00:49,790
- No, I'll miss you...
- Just leave.

14
00:00:53,047 --> 00:00:56,847
Ahh. Okay, now,
this is the way it's supposed to be.

15
00:00:57,009 --> 00:00:59,139
(Raj:)Men together, fighting the forces of evil.

